        "body": "## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When was the WARDOGS closed beta?\n\nThe WARDOGS closed beta ran August 21-23, 2026, the weekend before the Steam Early Access launch on September 10, 2026. Both the Steam store page and Eurogamer pre-launch coverage confirm the same three-day window.\n\n### Do you need to pre-order to get WARDOGS closed beta access?\n\nYes for this specific round. Pre-ordering WARDOGS through Steam before the August 21, 2026 cut-off gave automatic access. A smaller group of invited players from prior Closed Test sign-ups, Discord and Steam Playtest Request also received access. No public signup queue was offered.\n\n### Is the WARDOGS closed beta still running?\n\nNo. The August 21-23, 2026 weekend has already ended. The current playable milestone on the Steam store page is the Early Access launch on September 10, 2026. Future test weekends are not announced as of 2026-09-28.\n\n### Will there be another WARDOGS beta after Early Access?\n\nNot announced as of 2026-09-28. BULKHEAD has not published a post-EA public test schedule. Any future beta or playtest would be announced through the official BULKHEAD and Team17 channels and a fresh Steam Playtest Request."
