        "body": "## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### What vehicles are in WARDOGS at launch?\n\nWARDOGS vehicles at Steam Early Access launch are attack helicopters, transport helicopters, tanks, and tank-mounted artillery, per the Steam store page for AppID 1867240 and BULKHEAD's \"Early Access & Beyond\" reveal.\n\n### Are fighter jets in WARDOGS at launch?\n\nFighter jets are confirmed as a future unlockable WARDOGS vehicle that will arrive later in the EA cycle. The exact season for the fighter jet unlock is not announced as of 2026-09-28.\n\n### Do WARDOGS vehicles cost cash?\n\nYes. WARDOGS vehicles are bought with the per-match cash wallet, which carries across deaths and across matches. Specific vehicle prices are subject to Early Access tuning as of 2026-09-28.\n\n### Can tanks destroy buildings in WARDOGS?\n\nThe WARDOGS gameplay loop ties tank pushes to destructible environment actions like knocking over apartment buildings. The same destructible-and-buildable framing covers Fortify placements and forward operating base construction by the builder role.\n\n### How do vehicles change in Hardcore mode?\n\nHardcore mode forces every WARDOGS vehicle into first-person camera, removes killcam, simplifies the HUD, and limits kill feed to squad. Specific Hardcore mode vehicle balance changes are subject to Early Access tuning as of 2026-09-28."
